{"id":276110508,"title":"254. express元源码分析-koa源码分析-数据库等","summary":"数据库-数据库的介绍，作用和分类（理解）非关系数据库回存在大量的数据冗余","content":"<p>数据库-数据库的介绍，作用和分类（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783323190107-dab5e830-63fe-45b2-86a9-b53caae072e0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783323331427-b6f6add2-cf8c-4fa4-9c9d-a82707e56bf4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>非关系数据库回存在大量的数据冗余</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783323683363-235d6ed3-b61b-4843-a339-40bb53942234.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783323742317-3ce424da-0726-4e39-ad74-10384c7609ed.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-数据库介绍，安装，下载</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783324027217-78dcc665-3df3-485f-ab14-2dc90d5e2c05.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783324032747-15af65c4-3181-4709-b059-286736046b43.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783325567792-af927437-562f-4479-b511-31e31e37a2fd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783325580441-e88d8b91-462d-403f-8024-1a29f4dae60a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783325644181-ebdff878-b33e-4fc5-a4ee-6d4b59f1e7c6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>创建数据库</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783325813755-8c7fa978-c198-4198-b87d-84cdb49b88bf.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783325907035-42559