26/png/69792028/1783328479656-0828ea8e-ca8e-4c19-8823-9ca208c97c97.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>创建数据库也可以使用默认的编码<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783328543518-1db12cf5-34ce-41c3-9374-749b3f9ab7e5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>4.<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783328569499-ddcc5c63-9105-4539-acc8-04cc5e1fcd1a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这样写更加严谨一点<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783328597860-b020b4b3-0472-4f9e-8352-be4315d88de4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783328627899-5c55d3e6-e3a1-4a4b-b19a-dee38e9916ba.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783328749335-60647ec2-7491-44f4-b981-9b2f2d17ec7a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783328765135-df13b805-8302-4f58-9b4c-d9caaac6c95d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783328773411-b836fc01-4f88-48cc-9dc0-3134135f64b2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783328784501-51252b83-10a1-40f4-bf8e-5201b659cb94.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783328791238-5ba3226a-80e6-4c61-85e8-15fcd008cff2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783328879653-717c600e-3e89-4a91-990a-708e8dbb846e.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783328922840-e38eb498-6acc-4941-b109-b3c3361e68e4.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2